{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/about.png?t=1743480942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO SUBSTANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JUST PEAK\u00a0\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast and crash through hordes of <strong><i><u>Hell</u></i></strong>'s strongest warriors as a (Human? Statue?? Creature???) <strong><i><u>Goofy Goober</u></i></strong> fighting through all rings of the iconic down-under for <strong><i><u>Revengeance</u></i></strong> of <strong><i><u>unknown proportion</u></i></strong>. One thing is certain: There Will be <u><strong><i>Blood Shed</i></strong></u>. Grab a weapon, equip an item and slice through <strong><i><u>Twin Raging Titans, Ghastly Apparitions, Big Tank,</u></i></strong> and <strong><i><u>Lil' Scratchy</u></i></strong>. What lies at the end of these Wacky Hijinks..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There might also be a <strong><i><u>Fishing Minigame</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I <strong><i><u>don't</u></i></strong> really <strong><i><u>know</u></i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/features.png?t=1743480942\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling roguelike gameplay to the darkest depths of <strong><i><u>Hell</u></i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectable skins and costumes to personalize your very own Goober</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting challenges to spice up regular gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of enemies and bosses bent on stopping your scrummage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Song OST to get your blood PUMPING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769700/extras/goobert.gif?t=1743480942\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blood On Your Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/e75575c7163ab34dae7ee95528e2b564354c5f2a.jpg"},{"name":"$$Microtransaction$$","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/a6c73f9b3061827fd536de772a4384ebd3ebd05d.jpg"},{"name":"Demonspawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/958dc697f37f5ce3293d3098df604d319e864882.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/3412ad53a19fe7339836260b7125dea223dd37f4.jpg"},{"name":"Double Goofyberry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/5f96b3d25f2c6b7ea544d7e2724d871622846ced.jpg"},{"name":"Head Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/bc1cefcde8ed08fea0397afae6269da0a0b7a534.jpg"},{"name":"High Noon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/432559f7f316d04d9cb741c96f22ec1bf437d742.jpg"},{"name":"Dead Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/423a51b5fcfee85c5614a8390b261951b3672b3a.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/fa8a84362091fd0ba07e07dde3e852f09435d03b.jpg"},{"name":"EXORCIST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2769700/211d9049f81d54d62d7fcfe25d